Source: shfm-models
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Massimo Cavalleri <massimo.cavalleri@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/massimo82/shfm
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: shfm-models
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shfm (>> 0.2.10)
Conflicts: shfm-models-4b
Description: embedding and reranker models for shfm's semantic search (small)
 Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B (Q8_0) and Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B (Q4_K_M), about 1 GB,
 in /usr/share/shfm/models, for shfm's semantic search on file contents.
 shfm-models-4b has the larger, better embedding model instead. Models in
 ~/.cache/shfm/models come first, role by role.

Package: shfm-models-4b
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shfm (>> 0.2.10), curl, ca-certificates
Conflicts: shfm-models
Description: embedding and reranker models for shfm's semantic search (4B)
 Downloads Qwen3-Embedding-4B (Q8_0) and Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B (Q4_K_M) from
 Hugging Face when installed, about 4.7 GB, checks their checksums and puts
 them in /usr/share/shfm/models, for shfm's semantic search on file
 contents: better retrieval than shfm-models, slower queries. Removing the
 package removes them. Models in ~/.cache/shfm/models come first, role by
 role.
